---
import BlogLayout from "../layouts/BlogLayout.astro";
---

<BlogLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  heroTitle="Privacy Policy"
  heroSubtitle="Last updated: November 24, 2026"
>
  <section class="card page-card">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        AITech8 (“this site”, aitech8.com) respects the privacy of its
        visitors. This policy explains what information this site collects,
        how it is used, and what choices you have. This site does not
        require registration and does not actively collect personal
        information such as your name or email address.
      </p>
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        This site has no registration or login, and does not collect
        personal information such as your name, email address, or phone
        number. The server may record routine technical information when
        serving the site, such as the time of access, pages visited,
        browser type, and IP address, only to keep the site running and
        to troubleshoot issues. It is not used to identify individual
        visitors.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site uses Google Analytics to understand aggregate usage,
        such as which pages are visited and which browsers and devices
        are used. Google Analytics collects anonymized usage data and
        does not identify individual visitors. You can opt out of Google
        Analytics by installing the Google Analytics Opt-out Add-on in
        your browser.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies and Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses browser local storage to remember your
        preferences, such as the dark / light theme. This data stays in
        your own browser and is not uploaded to any server.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site displays advertisements served by Google AdSense.
        Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads
        based on a user’s prior visits to this site or other websites.
        Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners
        to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and/or
        other sites on the Internet. You may opt out of personalized
        advertising by visiting{" "}
        <a
          href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Google Ads Settings
        </a>
        . You may also opt out of a third-party vendor’s use of cookies
        for personalized advertising by visiting{" "}
        <a
          href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          www.aboutads.info/choices
        </a>
        .
      </p>
      <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links, including links to
        AI tools and software services. If you sign up for or purchase a
        product through an affiliate link, this site may earn a
        commission at no extra cost to you. All affiliate links are
        marked with rel="sponsored nofollow". Affiliate relationships
        do not influence which tools are covered or how they are ranked;
        see our{" "}
        <a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy</a> for how
        reviews and comparisons are produced.
      </p>
      <h2>Third-Party Services and External Links</h2>
      <p>
        Articles on this site may contain links to third-party websites.
        Once you click them, the third party’s privacy policy applies,
        and this site is not responsible for their content or their
        privacy practices.
      </p>
      <h2>Children’s Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This site is not directed at children under the age of 13, and
        does not knowingly collect personal information from children.
      </p>
      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can clear data stored locally by this site, including
        cookies, at any time through your browser settings, or simply
        stop using this site. Because this site does not collect
        personal identity information, there is no personal account data
        to access, correct, or delete. If you have any privacy-related
        question, you can reach us at{" "}
        <a href="mailto:hello@aitech8.com">hello@aitech8.com</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>Policy Updates</h2>
      <p>
        This policy may be updated as the site’s services change, for
        example when an advertising or analytics service is added. The
        updated version will be published on this page, and the “Last
        updated” date at the top of the page will show when it changed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BlogLayout>
